<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="01">
<name>Engine</name>
<section id="10006_S000J" variety="S000J">
<name>Engine Control</name>
<ttl id="10006_S000J_74WIJ_T00FO" variety="T00FO">
<name>EFI System (2GR-FE)</name>
<para id="RM00000211400QX" category="C" type-id="303Q3" name-id="066OC-00" from="200708">
<dtccode>P1603</dtccode>
<dtcname>Engine Stall Detected</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000211400QX_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000DAP00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<list1 type="nonmark">
<item>
<ptxt>The DTC is output when the engine stops after the engine has started. Since the conditions when the DTC was output are stored, the freeze frame data can be checked using SST (TaSCAN). Serviceability is improved by making it possible to check the engine operating condition at the time of the engine stall using the freeze frame data. Also, since an engine stall caused by running out of fuel is also detected, it is necessary to check whether the vehicle has run out of fuel before starting work. (An engine stall may be detected due to cranking while the engine is running, even if the engine does not stop)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1" pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<colspec colnum="01" colname="C01" colwidth="1.60in"/>
<colspec colnum="02" colname="C02" colwidth="5.48in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTCNo.</ptxt>
<ptxt>SAE</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
<ptxt>1. Detection condition 2. Malfunction status 3. Malfunction duration 4. Other</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>P1603</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="left">
<list1 type="ordered">
<item>
<ptxt>5 seconds or more have elapsed after starting, engine running</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Engine stopped by a means other than ignition switch operation</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>0.5 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>1 trip</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000211400QX_02" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000DAQ00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>If other DTCs are displayed, troubleshoot the corresponding DTCs first.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Since DTC 1603 differs from conventional diagnostic trouble codes, the diagnostic procedure below is described as 1 possible method.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000211400QX_03" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM00000211400QX_03_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000DAR00000">
<scantool type="1"/>
<testtitle>Read DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the DTCs by following the SST (TaSCAN) screen display. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000008YS014X"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<colspec colnum="01" colname="C01" colwidth="3.06in"/>
<colspec colnum="02" colname="C02" colwidth="1.07in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Only P1603 is displayed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Other DTCs are displayed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000211400QX_03_0002" fin="false">A</down>
<right ref="RM00000211400QX_03_0004" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000211400QX_03_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___0000DAS00000">
<testtitle>Check Freeze Frame Data</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Use the time-series freeze frame data to check the data at and after DTC detection, to assist with troubleshooting.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Following the screen display of SST (TaSCAN), check the time-series freeze frame data, and check the vehicle condition at the time of the engine stall. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000CD2022X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the freeze frame data for when the engine is cold / warmed up.</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Name</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Abbreviation</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Engine Coolant Temperature</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>THW</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Engine Oil Temperature</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>EOT</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the freeze frame data for idling / constant speed driving / deceleration / acceleration / starting off / stopping.</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Name</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Abbreviation</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Engine Speed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ESPD</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Vehicle Speed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>SPD1</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Throttle SensorNo.1 Opening</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>THP1</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Throttle SensorNo.2 Opening</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>THP2</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Accelerator SensorNo.1 Opening</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ACP1</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Accelerator SensorNo.2 Opening</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ACP2</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Neutral Start SW</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>NSW</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Stop Light SW</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>STP</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the freeze frame data for the shift range / lock-up condition at the time of the engine stall.</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Name</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Abbreviation</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ECT Shift Position</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>RECT</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Lock-up Status</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>RL/U</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the freeze frame data for engine load / electrical load.</ptxt>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Name</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Abbreviation</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Engine Load Value</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>CALO</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Electrical Load Signal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ELS</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A/C Signal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A/C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check the items above and perform a reproduction test.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Based on each freeze data and reproduction test, compare with the reference values in the ECU Data Monitor list (<xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000CCZ03QX"/>) and identify the malfunctioning area.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<colspec colnum="01" colname="C01" colwidth="3.11in"/>
<colspec colnum="02" colname="C02" colwidth="1.02in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Malfunctioning part can be identified</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Malfunctioning part cannot be identified</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000211400QX_03_0003" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM00000211400QX_03_0005" fin="true">B</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000211400QX_03_0003">
<testtitle>Inspect and Repair Malfunctioning Area</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000211400QX_03_0004">
<testtitle>Go to Related DTC Chart<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001KT7004X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000211400QX_03_0005">
<testtitle>Inspection for Intermittent Problems<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000CD101YX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
